s enumerate coverage only; card order does not imply dependency or traffic. IAM, DNS, circuits and workloads are not inferred beyond source.&lt;br&gt;Read-only data lookups (not created resources): oci_objectstorage_namespace.this" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FCFBFA;strokeColor=#9E9892;fontColor=#312D2A;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20.00" y="460.00" width="2560.00" height="130.00" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
